            <title>[LU-20889] Miscellaneous test framework and suite fixes</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20889</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I recently tasked Claude with running all of the test suites in ltvm VMs; while this generated a bunch of ltvm fixes, it's also finding a bunch of small test framework and suite problems due to how its running the tests (eg, running a bunch of them separately).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This ticket is to collect all of the fixes it finds in one place - it's going to be a blizzard of small stuff, and we'll have to decide what to do with it.  I'm going to mark everything forjanitoronly/forbuildonly for now so we don't waste autotest time on a blizzard of small stuff, and we'll unmark as we triage the fixes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
